    can be precisely described as:

    .. math::
        \begin{aligned}
            out(N_i, C_j, h, w) ={} & \max_{m=0, \ldots, kH-1} \max_{n=0, \ldots, kW-1} \\
                                    & \text{input}(N_i, C_j, \text{stride[0]} \times h + m,
                                                   \text{stride[1]} \times w + n)
        \end{aligned}

